    Cancellation</I>&rdquo;, conditional upon LBG being solvent at the time when the relevant payment is due to be made and no principal,
    interest or other amount payable shall be due and payable in respect of or arising from the Additional Tier 1 Securities except to the
    extent that LBG could make such payment and still be solvent immediately thereafter (such condition is referred to herein as the &ldquo;<B>Solvency
    Condition</B>&rdquo;).</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.1in">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt">LBG shall be considered to be solvent at a particular point
