    shall not apply to LBG&rsquo;s obligations to pay the fees and expenses of, and to indemnify, the Trustee and the Trustee&rsquo;s rights
    to apply money collected to first pay its fees and expenses shall not be subject to the subordination provisions set forth in the Indenture.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.1in">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt">Holders may not require any redemption of the Additional
Tier 1 Securities at any time.</P></TD></TR>
