    <TD STYLE="width: 50%; border-top: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; border-bottom: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt"><B>Distribution of securities distributed to holders of deposited securities which are distributed by the depositary to ADS registered holders.</B></TD></TR>
