<BR>
</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-top: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; border-bottom: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt"><B>Expenses of the depositary</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-top: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; border-bottom: #7F7F7F 1pt solid">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Cable, telex and facsimile transmissions (when expressly provided in
    the deposit agreement).</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Converting foreign currency to US Dollars.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><B>Taxes and other governmental charges the depositary or the custodian have to pay on any ADS or share underlying an ADS, for example, stock transfer taxes, stamp duty or withholding taxes</B></P>
                                <P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&nbsp;<B><BR></B></P></TD>
    <TD>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">As necessary.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-top: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; border-bottom: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt"><B>Any charges incurred by the depositary or its agents for servicing the deposited securities</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-top: #7F7F7F 1pt solid; border-bottom: #7F7F7F 1pt solid">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">As necessary.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
